1
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:06,000
Taming The Husband

2
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:09,000
Episode 12

3
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,720
As you saw,

4
00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:25,040
I did take some silver

5
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:27,120
to make Mr. Huang's

6
00:01:27,520 --> 00:01:28,760
injuries sound worse.

7
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:32,120
He's been able to walk for days.

8
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Yes.

9
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,400
Baozhu,

10
00:01:38,960 --> 00:01:40,360
do you look down on me?

11
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:43,320
Why would you ask that?

12
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:45,680
I sell my principles to earn a living,

13
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:49,200
and in private, I'm so disgusting.

14
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,200
No.

15
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,920
I change my tune for customers, too,

16
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:54,240
just to sell some pork.

17
00:01:54,360 --> 00:01:55,360
Besides,

18
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:57,680
I couldn't even get you that letter.

19
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,120
I'm sorry.

20
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,840
It's my background.

21
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,160
I was born low.

22
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:10,840
Everyone looks down on me.

23
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:15,320
Except you.

24
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:17,760
You and I are the same.

25
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,960
Why don't you wipe that off first?

26
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:25,320
You're still bleeding.

27
00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:30,280
You find me disgusting, too?

28
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,400
You think I'm beneath you?

29
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:33,800
No!

30
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:36,360
Why would I look down on you?

31
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:38,600
And I won't tell anyone.

32
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:41,240
I only came to ask you something.
Then I'll go.

33
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:45,400
Why didn't you ask for my help that day?

34
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,120
I could have helped you.

35
00:02:48,880 --> 00:02:51,400
Then… give me some advice.

36
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:53,320
How do I get rid of Mr. Huang?

37
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:58,680
I could help, but I don't know
what Young Master Xie wants.

38
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:02,080
True.

39
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:04,400
I'll ask him when he gets back.

40
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:08,200
I can write a letter to him for you.

41
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:13,480
Gone to ask for money.

42
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:15,520
Excuse me. Do you know
where Young Master Xie is?

43
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:17,480
You're looking for him? So are we!

44
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:19,280
-Come on!
-Let's go!

45
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,160
Let's talk this over!
Talk it over!

46
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:24,920
Young Master Xie,
you'd better leave first.

47
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,000
Don't be afraid.

48
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,280
We have to break this up to rebuild it.

49
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,520
Now's the time.

50
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:29,760
Enough!

51
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:31,240
Listen to me.

52
00:03:31,600 --> 00:03:33,200
We're all trying to earn a living.

53
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:35,520
Why make it so hard for each other?

54
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:36,680
That's rich!

55
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:38,520
He was born
with a silver spoon in his mouth!

56
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:39,840
He just mistreats the servants.

57
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:41,640
What does he know about our troubles?

58
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:43,920
-That's right!
-Docking our pay every day!

59
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,400
Do you even want us to work?

60
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:46,680
Yes! Of course we do!

61
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:48,560
Fine! Then send him away!

62
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:51,040
Bring First Master Xie here
to give us justice!

63
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:53,120
Yes! Give us justice!

64
00:03:55,160 --> 00:03:56,840
You troublemakers!

65
00:03:57,200 --> 00:03:58,720
Are you rebelling?

66
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:01,520
How dare you insult
the man who feeds you?

67
00:04:01,640 --> 00:04:04,440
Who are you trying to scare?
Brothers, throw them out!

68
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:05,520
Go!

69
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:07,480
Don't! Don't!

70
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:09,360
-Out of the way!
-Calm down!

71
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:11,400
-All right.
-Let me see you out.

72
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,600
Nicely done, Young Master Xie!

73
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:21,040
But--
One little twist,

74
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:22,560
and you've broken my arm!

75
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:25,480
They insulted you. Why not hit them?

76
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,560
Shut your mouth!

77
00:04:27,440 --> 00:04:29,240
They work day and night for the Xies.

78
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:31,160
They're the ones who feed us!

79
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:33,280
I'm the one who owes them respect.

80
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,240
Please, all of you, bear witness.

81
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:39,560
If anyone has a grievance, speak up.

82
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:41,400
I'll see that justice is done.

83
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:43,800
Fine words!

84
00:04:43,960 --> 00:04:45,640
We work ourselves to death,

85
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:48,040
and you still dock our pay! Admit it!

86
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:49,720
That's right!

87
00:04:51,080 --> 00:04:52,160
Think money's easy to earn?

88
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,480
Who told you to do that?

89
00:04:58,480 --> 00:05:00,920
Well…
Didn't you tell us to oversee the work?

90
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,680
Oversee the work,

91
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,080
not dock their pay!

92
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:07,560
I gave you 100 taels in bonuses
to share among them!

93
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:09,480
Did that money go to the dogs?

94
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:10,880
No, no, Young Master Xie!

95
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:12,360
What 100 taels?

96
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:14,840
-Didn't any of you get it?
-No! No!

97
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:17,000
Then these two pocketed it themselves.

98
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:18,560
-What should we do with them?
-Beat them! Beat them!

99
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:19,640
Beat him!

100
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:21,360
No! We didn't!

101
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:26,720
Stop! Stop hitting us!

102
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:30,480
Everyone, please hear me out.

103
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:32,160
Now we know the truth.

104
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:34,360
Let me deal with these two,

105
00:05:34,440 --> 00:05:35,760
then give you an answer.

106
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:38,280
I'll divide those 100 taels among you all.

107
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,720
Would that satisfy you?

108
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:42,320
Yes! Yes! Yes!

109
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:45,400
You two, look at yourselves!

110
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:47,600
Fat and well fed!

111
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:49,720
Now look at them.

112
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:51,840
Skin and bones!

113
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:55,800
Everything the Xies have
was built on their labor.

114
00:05:56,280 --> 00:05:59,240
I hired you to solve their problems,

115
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:01,280
not stand here
helping bullies prey on them!

116
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:03,480
Chickens and worms?

117
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:06,800
You're the worms here! Get out!

118
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:08,320
Out! Out! Out!

119
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:11,440
Stop! Stop hitting us! Stop!

120
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:12,840
Out! Out!

121
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:16,400
-Jianwei.
-Yes?

122
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:17,960
Get 100 taels from the bookkeeper.

123
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:19,440
Yes.

124
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:20,640
Everyone,

125
00:06:20,840 --> 00:06:21,840
you'll all get a share.

126
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:24,480
-Good! Young Master Xie!
-Let's go.

127
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:28,520
Young Master Xie! Young Master Xie!

128
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:30,040
Wonderful!

129
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:31,480
Young Master Xie!

130
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:42,240
-What brings you here?
-My lord, a letter for you.

131
00:06:43,520 --> 00:06:44,520
Thank you.

132
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:50,440
Zifang House / Shiqian House
Cooking pots / Restaurant

133
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:51,520
Slow down.

134
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,680
Slow down.

135
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:55,040
Inn

136
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:00,720
Have I upset you again?

137
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,240
Yes.

138
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:06,240
What do you want to write?

139
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:10,280
I'll write it myself.

140
00:07:10,520 --> 00:07:12,000
I'll ask if I get stuck.

141
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,600
All right.

142
00:07:29,320 --> 00:07:33,000
Xie Yan. Don't marry her

143
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:45,520
I'd better not look.

144
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:48,880
I'm going to look.

145
00:07:51,080 --> 00:07:52,240
You and Miss Huang…

146
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:53,320
what's going on between you?

147
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:01,720
What's so funny?

148
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:02,960
Why are you angry?

149
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:10,400
She's a very good person.

150
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:12,480
I don't want this.

151
00:08:20,320 --> 00:08:22,240
Our families were neighbors
in the capital,

152
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:23,320
and often visited each other.

153
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,920
Our elders decided, without asking us,

154
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,360
to betroth us as children.

155
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:30,480
But I rarely saw her.

156
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:33,440
When we moved back to Yangzhou,

157
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:35,040
we lost touch with them.

158
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:38,080
Last year,
they returned the betrothal document.

159
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:40,440
That ended the connection.

160
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:43,600
I really didn't know they were coming.

161
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,920
But I can guess what they want.

162
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,640
I won't agree to the match.

163
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:58,560
Don't worry.

164
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:01,880
So did marrying me

165
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:03,680
have anything to do with that breakup?

166
00:09:12,760 --> 00:09:14,400
-Yes.
-You…

167
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,480
Xie Yan, I hate you!

168
00:09:29,520 --> 00:09:34,040
Shanglin Inn

169
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:52,240
I'll hate you till the end of time!

170
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,360
Nothing could be better.

171
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:00,920
I don't understand!

172
00:10:01,040 --> 00:10:02,360
And stop teasing me!

173
00:10:20,880 --> 00:10:21,880
My lord,

174
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:27,560
why's your face so red?

175
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,080
Keep this safe for me.

176
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,360
Yes.

177
00:10:31,640 --> 00:10:32,640
Zifang House / Shiqian House
Cooking pots / Restaurant

178
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,960
My lord,
the bonuses have been paid out.

179
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:37,560
Post the notice I've just drawn up.

180
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:39,880
Then appoint a new steward

181
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:42,400
and a new bookkeeper.
I need to go home.

182
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,480
Yes.

183
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:46,320
Didn't you say we shouldn't rush?

184
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:52,120
Things change every day.

185
00:10:52,520 --> 00:10:53,920
Keep learning. Adapt. Understand?

186
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:58,880
And get my brush and ink ready.

187
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:00,480
I'm writing home.

188
00:11:00,920 --> 00:11:01,920
Yes.

189
00:11:02,040 --> 00:11:05,520
The Xie estate

190
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,680
You'd only just got home,

191
00:12:19,760 --> 00:12:21,560
and his letter was here!

192
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:24,200
Have some tea and rest, my lady.

193
00:12:24,760 --> 00:12:27,160
You're studying harder than ever.

194
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:29,040
Mind your eyes, too.

195
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:31,720
Of course! I've been working hard.

196
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:34,240
But this line…

197
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:36,200
I… It's such a tongue twister.

198
00:12:36,280 --> 00:12:38,200
I looked it up, but I still can't read it.

199
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:40,640
"Lure them with gain."

200
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:42,120
"Unsettle them with anger."

201
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:45,400
"Lure them with gain.
Unsettle them with anger."

202
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:47,040
"Lure them with gain."

203
00:12:47,560 --> 00:12:48,960
"Unsettle them with anger."

204
00:12:53,160 --> 00:12:54,840
I've no appetite.

205
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:56,960
Just bring me some roast duck,

206
00:12:57,040 --> 00:12:59,600
roast chicken, roast young goose,
braised pork, braised duck,

207
00:12:59,680 --> 00:13:00,920
soy-sauce chicken, cured pork,
stuffed pork,

208
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:03,960
air-dried pork, sausages,
and assorted cold cuts. That'll do.

209
00:13:04,160 --> 00:13:06,480
-Got all that?
-Very impressive.

210
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,360
Didn't remember a thing.

211
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:10,760
You!

212
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:12,240
Aren't you supposed to be ill?

213
00:13:14,760 --> 00:13:15,800
I just stretched.

214
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:18,560
All that effort,

215
00:13:18,640 --> 00:13:20,040
listing all those dishes,

216
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:21,720
and I'm wasting my breath!

217
00:13:21,800 --> 00:13:22,960
We're not even speaking the same language!

218
00:13:23,040 --> 00:13:24,400
Don't understand that, either.

219
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:25,640
It's all in the name.

220
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:26,960
What's not to understand?

221
00:13:27,040 --> 00:13:28,560
Are you two making a fool of me?

222
00:13:28,640 --> 00:13:29,840
Don't understand that, either.

223
00:13:39,880 --> 00:13:40,880
Illiterate.

224
00:13:42,920 --> 00:13:45,280
Can't read. You… can't read!

225
00:13:46,640 --> 00:13:47,640
Forget it, forget it, forget it.

226
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:49,840
This tea's cold.

227
00:13:50,160 --> 00:13:51,680
Get me some water.

228
00:13:52,280 --> 00:13:54,000
We've got boiling water, warm water,

229
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:55,560
cold water, perilla water,

230
00:13:55,640 --> 00:13:57,880
smoked plum water, longan water,
osmanthus and honey water.

231
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:59,640
Which water would you like?

232
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:02,600
Warm will do.

233
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:03,920
We've got ceramic pots, pewter pots,

234
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,280
silver pots, handled pots,

235
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:07,560
lidded bowls, teacups, porcelain cups,
carved lacquer cups.

236
00:14:07,640 --> 00:14:09,320
Which cup would you like?

237
00:14:09,400 --> 00:14:11,520
A lidded bowl. A lidded bowl.

238
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:13,560
-We have black tea, green--
-Stop!

239
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:16,280
I get it.

240
00:14:17,040 --> 00:14:18,400
Forget the water.

241
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:20,040
I'm actually hungry now.

242
00:14:20,640 --> 00:14:22,720
I'll tell you the dishes one last time.

243
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:24,520
Listen carefully.

244
00:14:26,880 --> 00:14:28,600
Roast duck, roast chicken,
roast young goose,

245
00:14:28,680 --> 00:14:30,080
braised pork, braised duck,
soy-sauce chicken, cured pork,

246
00:14:30,160 --> 00:14:31,920
stuffed pork, air-dried pork, sausages,

247
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:33,240
assorted cold cuts.

248
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:34,840
Please get those ready.

249
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:36,640
Mr. Huang insists on having them.

250
00:14:38,640 --> 00:14:40,520
You're putting us in a difficult spot.

251
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:42,520
Every courtyard's waiting for dinner.

252
00:14:42,640 --> 00:14:43,840
We've only got so many people.

253
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:45,400
Our masters have to come first.

254
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:47,600
How have we got time
to cook for the Huangs?

255
00:14:47,680 --> 00:14:48,680
Exactly.

256
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:50,720
How can you even ask?

257
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:51,840
Outrageous!

258
00:14:51,920 --> 00:14:53,040
What a joke!

259
00:14:54,680 --> 00:14:55,680
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

260
00:14:56,040 --> 00:14:58,800
It's just our honored guest
is in such a hurry.

261
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:00,840
He got hurt helping the Xie family.

262
00:15:00,920 --> 00:15:03,680
If we can't even give him a hot meal,

263
00:15:03,760 --> 00:15:06,200
who knows
what people will say about us?

264
00:15:06,280 --> 00:15:07,520
If our superiors hear,

265
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:09,280
we'll be the ones to suffer.

266
00:15:13,720 --> 00:15:15,000
We could make it.

267
00:15:15,200 --> 00:15:17,880
Whose courtyard
should we take a cook from?

268
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:25,440
You.

269
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:27,720
He's the second branch's cook.

270
00:15:27,800 --> 00:15:29,120
You can't take him!

271
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:31,360
Miss Xi has quite a temper!

272
00:15:33,040 --> 00:15:35,520
You spat at me just now,
didn't you?

273
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:36,600
What?

274
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:46,480
Off you go.

275
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:50,880
That's more like it.

276
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:52,600
Take good care of me,

277
00:15:52,680 --> 00:15:54,960
and I'll make sure
Grandmother and Youqing

278
00:15:55,040 --> 00:15:58,080
put in a good word with your elders.

279
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:07,800
As the saying goes,

280
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,360
good things take time.

281
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:10,720
Didn't you know?

282
00:16:11,120 --> 00:16:13,560
They haven't been visiting much

283
00:16:13,640 --> 00:16:16,440
because they've been sitting
with your elders.

284
00:16:16,520 --> 00:16:19,320
Chengjiang will be getting married soon!

285
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:25,280
This… this is too salty!

286
00:16:31,040 --> 00:16:32,040
Look! Look!

287
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:33,880
Look at that face!

288
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:35,960
Showing every feeling

289
00:16:36,080 --> 00:16:38,040
is a concubine's greatest mistake.

290
00:16:38,480 --> 00:16:40,480
As a woman,
you're a complete failure.

291
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:42,080
Furious, jealous,

292
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:43,400
and you have no class.

293
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:46,680
A woman
should learn to give way.

294
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:49,160
Never mind. Why am I telling you this?

295
00:16:49,240 --> 00:16:50,440
You wouldn't understand anyway.

296
00:16:55,600 --> 00:16:58,000
-It burns!
-Stealing the food off my plate?

297
00:16:58,080 --> 00:17:00,400
What? Can't afford to eat at home?

298
00:17:00,800 --> 00:17:01,960
Who are you?

299
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:04,240
Go and fetch
the lady of the house!

300
00:17:04,320 --> 00:17:05,360
We'll settle this!

301
00:17:05,560 --> 00:17:07,720
Is this
how the Xies treat their guests?

302
00:17:07,800 --> 00:17:09,760
Are these your family rules?

303
00:17:10,400 --> 00:17:12,200
I share Xie Yan's blood.

304
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:13,520
I'm his own sister!

305
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:16,440
Who are you to threaten me?

306
00:17:16,520 --> 00:17:18,200
-I--
-What's all this noise?

307
00:17:18,280 --> 00:17:19,280
Grandmother!

308
00:17:20,320 --> 00:17:22,080
Yulan, what's going on here?

309
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:23,160
And you!

310
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:24,960
You old hag!

311
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:26,520
Still shamelessly living here!

312
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:28,560
When my father was doing well,

313
00:17:28,640 --> 00:17:31,440
your family crawled all over us
to arrange a marriage!

314
00:17:31,560 --> 00:17:32,960
We finally agreed.

315
00:17:33,120 --> 00:17:36,440
Then trouble came,
and you couldn't wait to cut all ties!

316
00:17:36,520 --> 00:17:38,200
You even did everything you could

317
00:17:38,280 --> 00:17:39,760
to ruin Yan's reputation!

318
00:17:39,840 --> 00:17:40,840
Shame on you!

319
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:43,400
Shame! Shame!
Shame! Shame! Shame!

320
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:45,000
Xi!

321
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:46,400
-Don't hold me back!
-Xi!

322
00:17:46,800 --> 00:17:48,760
Let go! Let go of me!

323
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:52,280
-Don't be angry, Grandmother!
-Saying my brother's a curse on women!

324
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:53,440
You're a woman yourself!

325
00:17:53,520 --> 00:17:54,520
-You had parents, too!
-Lady Jin!

326
00:17:54,600 --> 00:17:55,600
With children of your own!

327
00:17:55,680 --> 00:17:57,400
Aren't you afraid those words will curse

328
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:58,720
your own descendants?

329
00:17:58,800 --> 00:18:00,360
You… Such a vicious girl!

330
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:01,600
So wicked!

331
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:03,800
No wonder your branch is so disliked!

332
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:05,840
Heaven will punish you!

333
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:07,840
What a sin!

334
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:11,600
I've already got one foot in the grave!

335
00:18:11,680 --> 00:18:13,040
Then what are you still doing here?

336
00:18:13,160 --> 00:18:15,840
Go and find someone
to build you a good, solid coffin!

337
00:18:15,920 --> 00:18:17,440
Put both feet in!

338
00:18:17,520 --> 00:18:19,000
Give the rest of us some peace!

339
00:18:19,560 --> 00:18:21,560
And you, go and have
a coffin made for your grandmother!

340
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:22,640
Go, go, go! Hurry! Hurry!

341
00:18:22,800 --> 00:18:24,040
Someone, drag her out!

342
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:26,880
Enough! Let go of me!

343
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:28,440
Quick, quick! Get her out!

344
00:18:28,520 --> 00:18:29,600
-Don't tire yourself out.
-Grandmother!

345
00:18:29,720 --> 00:18:32,960
-Grandmother, are you all right?
-Our Xi is still young and hotheaded.

346
00:18:33,040 --> 00:18:34,200
She speaks her mind.

347
00:18:34,360 --> 00:18:36,600
-But you--
-At my age,

348
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:39,880
I came all this way to make friends,

349
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:42,360
and you make enemies of us!

350
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:45,040
What kind of hospitality is this?

351
00:18:45,120 --> 00:18:46,760
You're taking food
off other people's tables!

352
00:18:46,840 --> 00:18:49,840
You call yourself a guest?
Why don't you take a bowl

353
00:18:49,920 --> 00:18:51,360
and beg in the street?

354
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:53,440
Go and beg for your meals!

355
00:18:53,520 --> 00:18:55,720
Get out of our house! Take her away!

356
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:57,360
Get out!

357
00:18:57,440 --> 00:18:58,880
-What sort of people are you?
-Stop sponging off us!

358
00:19:02,280 --> 00:19:03,840
-Grandmother!
-I'm furious!

359
00:19:04,040 --> 00:19:05,040
I don't want it!

360
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:11,200
Let's just go home.

361
00:19:11,360 --> 00:19:12,360
They're right.

362
00:19:12,720 --> 00:19:14,840
We're the ones
who turned our backs when they fell.

363
00:19:15,360 --> 00:19:16,840
So what?

364
00:19:17,120 --> 00:19:18,360
We all want to rise in the world.

365
00:19:18,480 --> 00:19:20,160
Put out a pot of buns,

366
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:21,960
and the shameless eat their fill.

367
00:19:22,040 --> 00:19:23,440
The shy ones starve!

368
00:19:24,400 --> 00:19:25,400
Grandmother's right.

369
00:19:27,200 --> 00:19:28,680
This isn't over!

370
00:19:29,520 --> 00:19:30,880
After those insults,

371
00:19:31,400 --> 00:19:32,880
I won't let it go!

372
00:19:33,280 --> 00:19:34,840
Think your father's position

373
00:19:34,920 --> 00:19:36,000
in the capital counts for nothing?

374
00:19:36,720 --> 00:19:41,320
We'll see who has the stronger arm!

375
00:19:42,080 --> 00:19:43,360
Waiter! Some tea.

376
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:44,720
Coming right up!

377
00:19:50,920 --> 00:19:53,360
The new steward and bookkeeper
are all taken care of.

378
00:19:53,520 --> 00:19:54,760
We can go home now.

379
00:19:55,560 --> 00:19:57,240
Are you Young Master Xie?

380
00:19:58,040 --> 00:20:00,440
The sluice officer sent us
to inspect the route.

381
00:20:00,560 --> 00:20:01,600
Here's the warrant.

382
00:20:01,960 --> 00:20:04,640
The route your men surveyed
doesn't meet regulations.

383
00:20:04,720 --> 00:20:06,960
Too many shallows and obstructions.
You'll have to change course.

384
00:20:07,520 --> 00:20:08,680
Inspection warrant

385
00:20:08,760 --> 00:20:10,080
Follow the official route.

386
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:11,360
Dredge the shoals first.

387
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:12,720
Once it passes inspection,

388
00:20:12,800 --> 00:20:14,440
you may sail on.

389
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:16,720
But dredging the shoals,

390
00:20:16,960 --> 00:20:18,760
then adding over a hundred li…

391
00:20:19,360 --> 00:20:20,640
Why take such a long way around?

392
00:20:20,720 --> 00:20:22,160
It's the safest route.

393
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:24,840
This is the emperor's grain.
If something goes wrong,

394
00:20:24,920 --> 00:20:26,120
can you answer for it?

395
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:29,920
Jianwei,

396
00:20:31,800 --> 00:20:33,800
go and fetch our sounding crew.

397
00:20:34,440 --> 00:20:35,440
I asked already.

398
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:37,080
Your uncle said the ships needed work,

399
00:20:37,160 --> 00:20:38,600
and borrowed every last man.

400
00:20:40,600 --> 00:20:42,680
If we don't follow their rules,

401
00:20:43,080 --> 00:20:44,520
they won't even open the sluice!

402
00:20:53,600 --> 00:20:55,760
Didn't he say he'd be back today?

403
00:20:55,960 --> 00:20:58,240
It's been ages.
Why isn't he home?

404
00:20:58,680 --> 00:21:00,320
Maybe something

405
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:01,400
held him up.

406
00:21:01,880 --> 00:21:04,000
Things never go to plan, do they?

407
00:21:04,240 --> 00:21:06,680
Someone says he's a nuisance,

408
00:21:06,840 --> 00:21:08,520
but still saves him dinner.

409
00:21:09,920 --> 00:21:11,800
I'll twist that mouth right off you!

410
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:13,000
Come here!

411
00:21:13,240 --> 00:21:14,680
Say that again! I dare you!

412
00:21:20,960 --> 00:21:22,280
Please come with me.

413
00:21:22,760 --> 00:21:24,000
Go… where?

414
00:21:24,560 --> 00:21:26,040
You said there were obstructions.

415
00:21:26,440 --> 00:21:28,880
Come and see for yourselves.

416
00:21:29,440 --> 00:21:33,280
Invite Lord Lu Xian to witness it, too.

417
00:21:33,640 --> 00:21:34,640
But…

418
00:21:36,240 --> 00:21:38,440
It's such a long way!

419
00:21:38,680 --> 00:21:40,480
And it's raining!

420
00:21:40,560 --> 00:21:42,520
What if something happened to you?

421
00:21:42,600 --> 00:21:45,600
And we can't trouble Lord Lu.
He's so busy!

422
00:21:45,680 --> 00:21:46,960
The rain will clear.

423
00:21:47,040 --> 00:21:48,960
Grain transport is a matter of state.

424
00:21:49,240 --> 00:21:50,320
Lord Lu cares about the people's welfare.

425
00:21:50,400 --> 00:21:51,560
Why wouldn't he come?

426
00:21:52,040 --> 00:21:54,040
-But--
-Jianwei, go and invite him.

427
00:21:54,360 --> 00:21:56,120
-Yes.
-But…

428
00:22:01,040 --> 00:22:02,040
Sorry. Sorry.

429
00:22:04,080 --> 00:22:05,080
You!

430
00:22:05,360 --> 00:22:07,160
Even a cornered rabbit bites!

431
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:11,240
My granddaughter

432
00:22:11,760 --> 00:22:13,840
comes from a fine family in the capital.

433
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:17,360
She's beautiful and well brought up.

434
00:22:17,840 --> 00:22:20,440
On that mountain,

435
00:22:21,360 --> 00:22:24,000
she risked her life to help you!

436
00:22:24,880 --> 00:22:25,880
I don't understand.

437
00:22:26,120 --> 00:22:27,640
Why not say what you mean, Madam?

438
00:22:27,720 --> 00:22:31,160
Youqing has beauty and character.

439
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:33,280
If she marries into this family,

440
00:22:33,360 --> 00:22:35,320
she won't mistreat you.

441
00:22:35,400 --> 00:22:38,600
She'll even make your husband look good!

442
00:22:39,320 --> 00:22:40,960
She's a person, not an ornament.

443
00:22:41,120 --> 00:22:42,120
What do you mean, look good?

444
00:22:43,480 --> 00:22:46,560
What good will your sharp tongue do?

445
00:22:47,200 --> 00:22:48,720
He'll take a wife one day.

446
00:22:48,800 --> 00:22:50,840
If not Youqing, someone else.

447
00:22:51,280 --> 00:22:54,040
Rather than let some vicious woman in,

448
00:22:54,120 --> 00:22:58,000
why not willingly welcome Youqing?

449
00:22:58,240 --> 00:23:01,280
People will think well of you, too.

450
00:23:02,160 --> 00:23:03,480
People can say what they like.

451
00:23:03,560 --> 00:23:04,880
I'll live my own life.

452
00:23:14,560 --> 00:23:18,480
Isn't it odd
that Xie Yan still isn't home?

453
00:23:19,840 --> 00:23:21,800
Perhaps something held him up.

454
00:23:21,880 --> 00:23:23,200
Whatever it is,

455
00:23:23,480 --> 00:23:24,960
I trust him to sort it out.

456
00:23:26,120 --> 00:23:27,920
Can he command the wind and rain?

457
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:30,000
What do you mean?

458
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:33,400
The Huangs can.

459
00:23:34,760 --> 00:23:35,920
What are you doing to him?

460
00:23:36,040 --> 00:23:38,360
A county official can ruin a family.
A prefect can wipe one out.

461
00:23:38,440 --> 00:23:41,840
Even a petty official
can ruin you with a finger.

462
00:23:41,920 --> 00:23:43,960
Let alone one from the capital.

463
00:23:44,760 --> 00:23:47,320
That should give him enough trouble!

464
00:23:53,320 --> 00:23:54,760
Do you know where he is?

465
00:23:55,360 --> 00:23:57,160
Or what he's trying to do?

466
00:23:57,400 --> 00:23:58,920
Go rushing over,

467
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:01,240
and you may only make things worse.

468
00:24:02,080 --> 00:24:04,640
I know what you've done for the Xies.

469
00:24:05,400 --> 00:24:07,880
My grandson acted rashly

470
00:24:08,160 --> 00:24:10,000
and made you suffer.

471
00:24:10,160 --> 00:24:12,840
I owe you an apology.

472
00:24:13,840 --> 00:24:15,000
You're a titled lady.

473
00:24:15,400 --> 00:24:17,240
I couldn't accept such a bow.

474
00:24:19,440 --> 00:24:24,400
A man must know
when to bend and when to stand firm.

475
00:24:24,480 --> 00:24:26,920
Women are no different.

476
00:24:27,000 --> 00:24:30,520
This inner household
is a world of its own.

477
00:24:30,720 --> 00:24:32,040
When you bend or stand firm,

478
00:24:32,520 --> 00:24:34,800
you shape his world.

479
00:24:39,800 --> 00:24:41,200
If a man's world

480
00:24:41,640 --> 00:24:43,440
depends on a woman bending for him,

481
00:24:44,600 --> 00:24:46,080
what sort of man is he?

482
00:24:46,560 --> 00:24:47,880
Don't underestimate him.

483
00:24:48,200 --> 00:24:50,360
I'm an old woman
trying to give you some advice.

484
00:24:50,440 --> 00:24:51,920
Why get so angry?

485
00:24:52,160 --> 00:24:55,960
We women
all want our husband's love to ourselves.

486
00:24:56,320 --> 00:24:58,480
But that's not how the world works.

487
00:24:58,800 --> 00:25:01,520
One day, he'll need heirs
for the Xie family.

488
00:25:01,600 --> 00:25:03,880
Hold on too tight, and you'll lose him.

489
00:25:05,360 --> 00:25:06,440
You've spent too long

490
00:25:06,520 --> 00:25:08,760
being a woman in the inner household.
You've forgotten how to be a person.

491
00:25:08,840 --> 00:25:09,840
You!

492
00:25:11,920 --> 00:25:12,920
Fine!

493
00:25:14,560 --> 00:25:15,640
Very fine!

494
00:25:20,120 --> 00:25:22,280
Quick! Her palpitations are back!

495
00:25:22,480 --> 00:25:23,880
Take Madam back to rest.

496
00:25:24,120 --> 00:25:25,120
Go!

497
00:25:32,080 --> 00:25:33,960
We're in trouble, and you're eating?

498
00:25:34,280 --> 00:25:35,720
She'll certainly report you!

499
00:25:36,280 --> 00:25:38,760
I know.
I need a full stomach to fight.

500
00:25:39,120 --> 00:25:40,120
You eat, too.

501
00:25:45,840 --> 00:25:47,160
Don't blame the child.

502
00:25:48,440 --> 00:25:50,600
It's my poor health.

503
00:25:51,920 --> 00:25:53,440
At least I can still walk.

504
00:25:55,240 --> 00:25:57,240
Upsetting Grandmother like this!

505
00:25:57,640 --> 00:25:58,920
I don't care who she is.

506
00:25:59,360 --> 00:26:02,000
If anything happens
to a titled lady of the Huang family,

507
00:26:02,080 --> 00:26:03,800
anything at all,

508
00:26:03,880 --> 00:26:05,880
she'll answer to me!

509
00:26:06,880 --> 00:26:09,000
I'd only just started getting better.

510
00:26:09,360 --> 00:26:11,400
Now I'm worse again!

511
00:26:15,760 --> 00:26:17,120
Have Baozhu and Xi

512
00:26:17,680 --> 00:26:19,040
wait in the main hall.

513
00:26:19,720 --> 00:26:21,440
And inform Madam.

514
00:26:21,680 --> 00:26:23,840
Ask her to join us.

515
00:26:24,480 --> 00:26:25,480
Yes.

516
00:26:28,320 --> 00:26:29,320
Grandmother,

517
00:26:29,400 --> 00:26:30,560
are you all right?

518
00:26:36,760 --> 00:26:39,400
You repay kindness with cruelty!

519
00:26:39,800 --> 00:26:41,120
Deliberately tormenting us,

520
00:26:41,720 --> 00:26:44,720
stealing another courtyard's cook
to make our meals!

521
00:26:45,200 --> 00:26:46,200
And you!

522
00:26:46,560 --> 00:26:48,920
You barged in without knowing a thing,

523
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:50,720
and in front of everyone,

524
00:26:50,920 --> 00:26:52,120
cursed me to die!

525
00:26:52,600 --> 00:26:53,680
Poor me!

526
00:26:54,320 --> 00:26:55,960
I tried to keep the peace,

527
00:26:56,920 --> 00:26:58,400
and she got right in my face

528
00:26:59,680 --> 00:27:00,960
and hurled abuse!

529
00:27:02,000 --> 00:27:04,160
No. About those bandits,

530
00:27:07,560 --> 00:27:09,440
I'm easily bullied.

531
00:27:10,600 --> 00:27:11,800
Too kind for my own good.

532
00:27:12,200 --> 00:27:15,720
I can bear a little injustice,

533
00:27:16,200 --> 00:27:18,960
but my grandchildren must not suffer!

534
00:27:19,240 --> 00:27:23,240
The Xie family owes me an explanation!

535
00:27:24,200 --> 00:27:25,600
How thick can her skin be?

536
00:27:25,800 --> 00:27:27,320
How can she be so shameless?

537
00:27:27,400 --> 00:27:28,840
It must be like a city wall.

538
00:27:28,920 --> 00:27:30,480
One layer gone, and there's another!

539
00:27:31,360 --> 00:27:33,560
You've been rude to an elder.

540
00:27:34,360 --> 00:27:36,600
Both of you will serve tea

541
00:27:36,920 --> 00:27:38,600
and apologize to Madam Huang.

542
00:27:46,080 --> 00:27:47,240
I lost my head.

543
00:27:47,320 --> 00:27:48,440
I spoke out of turn

544
00:27:48,760 --> 00:27:49,840
and forgot my place.

545
00:27:50,320 --> 00:27:52,440
I offer you this tea

546
00:27:52,560 --> 00:27:53,680
and accept my punishment.

547
00:27:54,000 --> 00:27:56,680
Please forgive me, Madam Huang.

548
00:28:05,480 --> 00:28:06,560
It burns!

549
00:28:07,840 --> 00:28:08,840
No!

550
00:28:09,240 --> 00:28:10,240
It wasn't me!

551
00:28:11,600 --> 00:28:12,880
You did it on purpose!

552
00:28:14,800 --> 00:28:16,000
Then let me apologize.

553
00:28:16,320 --> 00:28:18,440
Enough. Let's go back.

554
00:28:18,720 --> 00:28:20,080
She feels so wronged!

555
00:28:20,160 --> 00:28:21,480
You're doing this on purpose!

556
00:28:21,840 --> 00:28:23,680
You won't let an old woman have peace!

557
00:28:24,040 --> 00:28:25,360
Then I'll kneel and serve it.

558
00:28:37,080 --> 00:28:39,120
That's my tea.
You needn't serve it.

559
00:28:51,560 --> 00:28:52,640
Matron Fang,

560
00:28:52,720 --> 00:28:53,840
why is today's tea

561
00:28:54,120 --> 00:28:56,360
so hot to the touch?

562
00:28:58,200 --> 00:28:59,480
It's my fault.

563
00:29:02,240 --> 00:29:04,040
I did it. I'll take responsibility.

564
00:29:04,280 --> 00:29:05,320
No one else is to blame.

565
00:29:05,920 --> 00:29:06,920
Want to settle accounts?

566
00:29:07,520 --> 00:29:08,520
Fine.

567
00:29:08,920 --> 00:29:09,960
Fourth month, day 12.

568
00:29:10,560 --> 00:29:11,960
Knife fish from Guazhou Ferry,

569
00:29:12,360 --> 00:29:13,680
chicken soup with dried scallops,

570
00:29:14,080 --> 00:29:16,000
Liaodong bear paw with spring bamboo,

571
00:29:16,200 --> 00:29:17,640
pigeon eggs with morels.

572
00:29:18,160 --> 00:29:19,720
36 taels of silver.

573
00:29:19,880 --> 00:29:20,880
Enough!

574
00:29:21,080 --> 00:29:22,480
Before a court official's family,

575
00:29:22,560 --> 00:29:24,000
how dare you!

576
00:29:24,800 --> 00:29:27,680
Madam Huang is a generous woman.

577
00:29:28,280 --> 00:29:29,840
Kneel and admit your fault,

578
00:29:30,240 --> 00:29:31,440
and we'll let it go.

579
00:29:33,040 --> 00:29:34,040
Kneel!

580
00:29:36,560 --> 00:29:37,560
Someone!

581
00:29:43,880 --> 00:29:45,000
Fourth month, day 13.

582
00:29:45,480 --> 00:29:46,840
Shark fin in abalone sauce,

583
00:29:47,080 --> 00:29:48,280
braised river fish,

584
00:29:48,560 --> 00:29:50,000
red bird's nest with rock sugar,

585
00:29:50,240 --> 00:29:51,520
fish maw with crab meat.

586
00:29:51,600 --> 00:29:53,120
53 taels of silver.

587
00:29:53,320 --> 00:29:54,320
Slap her!

588
00:29:54,760 --> 00:29:55,880
Fourth month, day 14.

589
00:29:55,960 --> 00:29:57,440
Steamed grouper,

590
00:30:07,320 --> 00:30:08,760
river fish with fine noodles,

591
00:30:08,960 --> 00:30:10,200
shiitakes with fermented black beans.

592
00:30:10,280 --> 00:30:11,720
41 taels of silver.

593
00:30:18,240 --> 00:30:19,240
-Matron Fang,
-I'll tell you,

594
00:30:19,360 --> 00:30:22,120
-our money doesn't grow on trees!
-Lady Jin didn't mean it!

595
00:30:22,200 --> 00:30:24,120
-We face the wind and rain,
-Hit me instead!

596
00:30:24,200 --> 00:30:25,200
and risk our lives to earn it!

597
00:30:25,280 --> 00:30:27,120
-Please don't hit her!
-It's not your family's money,

598
00:30:27,200 --> 00:30:28,320
so you don't care how you spend it!

599
00:30:28,760 --> 00:30:30,040
I'm petty.

600
00:30:30,440 --> 00:30:32,320
-Matron Fang!
-I have no class.

601
00:30:32,440 --> 00:30:33,680
But do you?

602
00:30:34,040 --> 00:30:35,560
Don't blame your dear granddaughter.

603
00:30:35,640 --> 00:30:38,080
Perhaps it's all about
those few pennies you stand to gain!

604
00:30:38,160 --> 00:30:39,720
Such an insolent child!

605
00:30:39,920 --> 00:30:41,280
Now I see.

606
00:30:41,480 --> 00:30:43,800
No wonder your husband
hasn't been home for days!

607
00:30:44,200 --> 00:30:45,200
Let her go!

608
00:30:51,520 --> 00:30:52,760
I haven't been home

609
00:30:53,040 --> 00:30:54,520
because someone's been plotting
against me.

610
00:31:13,920 --> 00:31:16,480
Take your wife home and sort this out.

611
00:31:16,680 --> 00:31:18,480
The shipping business can wait.

612
00:31:18,560 --> 00:31:21,680
Mother, this can't wait.

613
00:31:22,000 --> 00:31:23,280
We must discuss it now.
